NODE id=matrix/cortexclient.Client.QueueAppend kind=method
  digest=b3:5502bb38d50da80885ffbbc702df5433cbe9c9908ca86d138a53df9d988232c6 file=cortexclient/client.go range=753:759 lang=go exported=true byte_range=21839:22268
  sig=func (c *Client) QueueAppend(ctx context.Context, events []AppendEvent) (AppendAck, bool, error)
  doc=QueueAppend appends with degraded-mode buffering: while cortexd is down the\nbatch enters the bounded pending queue and is flushed, in sequence order,\nby the next successful reconnect. A full queue is an honest typed failure\nbefore a sequence is allocated, never a silent drop.
EDGES
